<section class="about-section container section-rule" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"><p class="eyebrow">About YAER</p><div class="about-grid"><div><h2 id="about-title">Ideas inspired by everyday life.</h2><p class="section-copy">YAER is where curiosity meets problem solving. Our ideas often begin with something surprisingly simple:</p><p class="section-copy about-question"><em>“Why does this have to be so difficult?”</em></p><p class="section-copy">We explore better ways to solve everyday problems and turn the ideas worth pursuing into thoughtful, practical products.</p><p class="section-copy">Sometimes, the answer becomes a product.</p></div><div class="about-principles">{principles.map(principle => <article><img src={`/assets/icons/${principle.icon}.svg`} width="34" height="34" alt="" /><div><h3>{principle.title}</h3><p>{principle.text}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
